; -*- ledger -*-
; This journal once carried "C 1,00 PLN = 1,00", which reduced every PLN
; amount to a bare number and so dropped its symbol and decimal comma
; from the report.  A conversion needs a commodity on each side, so that
; line has been an error since issue #3261, and PLN now reports as written.
D 1000,00 PLN
N $
N h
N PLN
N zł

